  "description": "Operating Area: Albania, Croatia, Greece - Ionian Sea, Montenegro, Slovenia, Venice\n\nBuilt by IAG Yachts and part of the Primadonna series, Silent World combines solid performance with a calm cruising style. Originally delivered in 2014, and now undergoing a refit scheduled for completion in spring 2026, she offers a fresh, modern atmosphere and well-planned living spaces. In addition, her efficient engines allow for a comfortable cruising speed of 12 knots and a top speed of 16 knots, all while maintaining moderate fuel consumption. Furthermore, equipped with stabilizers both at anchor and underway, Silent World ensures a smooth, quiet ride. She is a versatile yacht, ideal for family holidays, relaxed escapes, or entertaining guests in style.",
